{"type":"TEXT","ticket":7647,"id":"156d2e7295b0169e"}||{"x":55,"y":570,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":"Arial","fontSize":8,"fontWeight":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"初始化\nPWM_EN=0，RELCON/ENCON=0。\nF_RESET 预置高，再置 CTRL_EN=1。\n等待 1 ms 后读取反馈。\nPWM 停机保持 CTRL_EN=1。\nCTRL_EN=0 时反馈读数无效。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":384,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":7648,"id":"2a5eef36c154e635"}||{"x":55,"y":440,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":"Arial","fontSize":8,"fontWeight":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"接口方向\n按手册端子编号 1:1 插接。\nJ16 既定观察面左端 2上/1下。\nMBDL 手册观察面右上1/右下2。\nJ1 母座配合面须在 PCB 阶段复核。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":385,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":7649,"id":"fca18918243a968a"}||{"x":380,"y":160,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":"Arial","fontSize":8,"fontWeight":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"反馈使用条件\nLVCMOS33，VCCO=3.0–3.4 V，CTRL_EN DRIVE12。\nFPGA 关闭反馈脚内部上拉/下拉。\n每路 ≤100 kHz，A/B 相邻边沿间隔 ≥2 us。\nA侧每路总负载 ≤50 pF，同步时钟 ≥50 MHz。\nR35/C7 供电建立等待 1 ms。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":386,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":7650,"id":"e3faeff2dd686d9f"}||{"x":1350,"y":740,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":"Arial","fontSize":8,"fontWeight":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"PWM 电气审查暂停\n原板 300 Ω + 1 kΩ 输入回路\n在5 V最坏条件下尚不能保证\nCA-IS3211 推荐 IF=7–16 mA。\n原板 Q7 共 CATH 含故障关断。\n升压驱动需一并解决该约束。\n详见设计说明的计算与阻塞项。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":387,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
